      "updated": 1795003884245,
      "created": 1795002821322,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Docker-compose:\n\nservice1: build image from the\ndockerfile , then create a\ncontainer in specific port. \n\n\nservice2: pull mysql , then create a\ncontainer in another port.\n\nservice3: form manage my mysql\ncontainer pull phpMyadmin image ,\nthen create a container from it in\nanother port\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Docker-compose:\n\nservice1: build image from the dockerfile , then create a container in specific port. \n\n\nservice2: pull mysql , then create a container in another port.\n\nservice3: form manage my mysql container pull phpMyadmin image , then create a container from it in another port\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
